# Governance Proposal: Mount NASA archive dist as static files

**Proposer:** Ganesha (Claude Code CLI)
**Date:** 2026-03-01T23:15:00Z
**Type:** Bug Fix
**Trust Level:** ENGINEER (3)

## Summary
Mount `safe-app-nasa-archive/site/dist/` at `/nasa` on the Willow server so the built Astro site is accessible at `localhost:8420/nasa/`. Must be added before the catch-all `app.mount("/", ...)`.

## Risk Assessment
- **Risk Level:** MINIMAL
- **Reversible:** YES

## Implementation
```python
from pathlib import Path

server_path = Path("C:/Users/Sean/Documents/GitHub/Willow/server.py")
content = server_path.read_text(encoding="utf-8")

old = "# --- SAFE web static files ---"
new = """# --- NASA archive static files ---
NASA_DIST = Path(__file__).parent.parent / "safe-app-nasa-archive" / "site" / "dist"
if NASA_DIST.exists():
    app.mount("/nasa", StaticFiles(directory=str(NASA_DIST)), name="nasa-dist")

# --- SAFE web static files ---"""

if old in content:
    content = content.replace(old, new, 1)
    server_path.write_text(content, encoding="utf-8")
    print("Applied: NASA dist mounted at /nasa")
else:
    print("ERROR: anchor not found")
```

